      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790208837341,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Rule based using regex, keyword\nmatching.\n2. Zero llm cost",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Rule based using regex, keyword\nmatching.\n2. Zero llm cost",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4Eu7wJ0-yNil_zBrgO-7s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 425.9609375,
      "y": 1498.18359375,
      "width": 411.14587402343744,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b08",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 16507167,
      "version": 289,
      "versionNonce": 1298419871,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790208738761,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Use llm as a brain to decides input\nmessage is safe or not.\n2. sementic meaning is clearly understand\nby the llm.\n2. Catchs Violation related iputs\nmessages.   ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Use llm as a brain to decides input message is safe or not.\n2. sementic meaning is clearly understand by the llm.\n2. Catchs Violation related iputs messages.   ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9CePyDsJ-E1mUx1-nD_fM",
